#: discover/DiscoverObject.cpp:216
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip %1 is the distro name"
msgid ""
"Support for managing packages from %1 is incomplete; you may experience any "
"number of problems. Do not report bugs to KDE. It is highly recommended to "
"uninstall the <resource>packagekit-qt6</resource> package and use Discover "
"only to manage Flatpaks, Snaps, and Add-Ons.<para>%1 maintainers recommended "
"instead using the <command>pacman</command> command-line tool to manage "
"packages.</para>"
msgstr ""
"A compatibilidade con paquetes de %1 está incompleta, pode que teña "
"problemas. Non informe de fallos a KDE. Recoméndase encarecidamente "
"desinstalar o paquete <resource>packagekit-qt6</resource> e usar Discover só "
"para xestionar paquetes de Flatpak, paquetes de Snap e complementos.<para>O "
"equipo de mantemento de %1 recomendou usar mellor a ferramenta da liña de "
"ordes <command>pacman</command> para xestionar paquetes.</para>"

